@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
    FontColor black
    DiamondBackgroundColor white
    DiamondBorderColor black
}
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black

|Author / Client|
start
:Invoke build operation;
note right
    Entry points:
    CLI, VS Code, Web App,
    MCP Server, Hosted API
end note

|Build Service|
:Receive Markdown and template ID;
:Parse and validate Markdown;
if (Markdown valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Return Markdown diagnostics;
    stop
endif

:Load template manifest and schema;
if (Template found?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Return template not found;
    stop
endif

:Check template compatibility;
if (Template compatible?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report template-schema mismatch;
    stop
endif

:Bind AST to template;

|LaTeX Generator|
:Generate LaTeX source;
if (Generation successful?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Return LaTeX generation error;
    stop
endif

|Isolated Build Environment|
:Start sandboxed Tectonic compilation;
if (Sandbox limits satisfied?) then (yes)
    :Compile LaTeX using Tectonic;
else (no)
    :Report sandbox or resource-limit failure;
    stop
endif

if (Compilation successful?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Return Tectonic diagnostics;
    stop
endif

|PDF Metadata Processor|
:Embed original Markdown source;
:Embed template identifier;
:Embed template version;

|Build Service|
:Collect generated PDF;
:Collect build diagnostics;
:Return PDF and diagnostics;

|Author / Client|
:Receive generated PDF;
stop
@enduml